---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="IslandTwig Studios"
	description="Sports identity studio of Nick Holmquist. Identity for teams and communities, built on pride, community, and belonging."
	path="/"
>
	<Fragment slot="head">
		<meta name="apple-itunes-app" content="app-id=6753832202" />
	</Fragment>

	<!-- HERO -->
	<section class="hero-section">
		<svg class="stripe-mark" style="top: -10px; right: -20px; width: 260px; height: 260px; opacity: 0.5;" viewBox="0 0 200 200">
			<g transform="rotate(-22 100 100)">
				<rect x="20" y="30" width="140" height="16" rx="8" fill="var(--accent)" opacity="0.3"/>
				<rect x="45" y="60" width="140" height="16" rx="8" fill="var(--text-on-dark)" opacity="0.12"/>
				<rect x="10" y="90" width="100" height="16" rx="8" fill="var(--accent)" opacity="0.2"/>
				<rect x="60" y="120" width="140" height="16" rx="8" fill="var(--text-on-dark)" opacity="0.08"/>
			</g>
		</svg>
		<div class="content">
			<div class="hero-grid">
				<div class="hero">
					<p class="eyebrow a1">Sports Identity Studio</p>
					<h1 class="a2">Every great team has a <span class="accent-word">story.</span></h1>
					<p class="hero-subhead a3">Every great community has traditions. I create the identity that brings them together.</p>
					<div class="hero-actions a4">
						<a href="/legacy-session" class="btn btn-primary">Start a Legacy Session</a>
						<a href="/design" class="btn btn-secondary">See the work</a>
					</div>
				</div>
				<a href="/services" class="hero-image a3">
					<img src="/images/services/tier-system.jpg" alt="Utah Yeti full brand system: primary and secondary marks, wordmark lockups, jerseys, number set, and color palette" />
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- PROBLEM -->
	<section class="problem-band">
		<svg class="stripe-mark" style="bottom: -30px; right: -20px; width: 220px; height: 220px; opacity: 0.45;" viewBox="0 0 200 200">
			<g transform="rotate(-22 100 100)">
				<rect x="10" y="40" width="120" height="14" rx="7" fill="var(--accent)" opacity="0.25"/>
				<rect x="30" y="70" width="150" height="14" rx="7" fill="var(--band-text-strong)" opacity="0.08"/>
				<rect x="0" y="100" width="90" height="14" rx="7" fill="var(--accent)" opacity="0.15"/>
			</g>
		</svg>
		<div class="content">
			<p class="eyebrow">The Problem</p>
			<p class="problem-line">Most teams have a logo. Few have an identity that reflects who they are.</p>
			<p class="problem-sub">A logo marks you. An identity means something to the people who wear it.</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- PHILOSOPHY -->
	<section class="philosophy-band">
		<div class="content">
			<div class="philosophy-split">
				<div class="philosophy">
					<p class="eyebrow">Why this work matters</p>
					<h2>The best identities aren't designed in a vacuum. They're discovered.</h2>
					<p>When I played rugby, our branding never matched the pride we had for the team. The logo was generic, the merch was forgettable, and I always wished we had something people were actually excited to wear.</p>
					<p>That stuck with me. The identities that last aren't pulled from a template. They come from the people, the place, and the traditions a team already carries.</p>
					<blockquote class="pull-quote">I don't design logos for sports teams. I build identities that players wear with pride, fans rally behind, and communities remember.</blockquote>
				</div>
				<div class="philosophy-image">
					<img src="/images/case-studies/utah-hockey/mountaineers-symbols.jpeg" alt="Hidden symbols breakdown of the Mountaineers concept mark: letter M, hockey sticks, mountain silhouette, and color nod to the Salt Lake Golden Eagles" loading="lazy" />
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- PROCESS -->
	<section class="process-band">
		<svg class="stripe-mark" style="top: -20px; left: -30px; width: 200px; height: 200px; opacity: 0.4;" viewBox="0 0 200 200">
			<g transform="rotate(-22 100 100)">
				<rect x="20" y="30" width="120" height="14" rx="7" fill="var(--accent)" opacity="0.25"/>
				<rect x="40" y="60" width="140" height="14" rx="7" fill="var(--text-on-dark)" opacity="0.1"/>
				<rect x="10" y="90" width="90" height="14" rx="7" fill="var(--accent)" opacity="0.15"/>
			</g>
		</svg>
		<div class="content">
			<p class="eyebrow">The Legacy to New Era™ System</p>
			<h2>How an identity gets built.</h2>
			<div class="process-grid">
				<div class="process-card">
					<span class="process-num">01</span>
					<h3>Discover the Legacy</h3>
					<p>Meet the people who know the team best. Research the place. Learn the traditions and the stories no outsider would know.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="process-card">
					<span class="process-num">02</span>
					<h3>Define the Identity</h3>
					<p>Translate those stories into themes, symbolism, and creative direction.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="process-card">
					<span class="process-num">03</span>
					<h3>Craft the System</h3>
					<p>Design the complete visual identity, from primary mark to the full set a team wears and lives in.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="process-card">
					<span class="process-num">04</span>
					<h3>Launch into a New Era</h3>
					<p>Help the community embrace it through apparel, uniforms, and rollout.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- SELECTED WORK -->
	<section class="work-band">
		<div class="content">
			<div class="work-header">
				<p class="eyebrow">Selected Work</p>
				<a href="/design" class="arrow-link">
					View all work
					<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
				</a>
			</div>

			<a href="/design/utah-hockey" class="hero-design">
				<div class="hero-design-image">
					<img src="/images/case-studies/utah-hockey/card-hero.jpg" alt="Composite grid of nine Utah Hockey concept logos designed for the new Utah NHL franchise: Yeti, Outlaws, Mammoth, Mountaineers, Swarm, and Black Diamonds among them" />
				</div>
				<div class="hero-design-body">
					<span class="cat-tag">Sports identity · Concept · NHL</span>
					<h2>Naming Utah's Hockey Team</h2>
					<p class="hero-design-desc">Nine identity directions for Utah's new NHL franchise, designed in real time across thirteen months. Includes a Mammoth concept posted a year before the team picked Mammoth.</p>
					<span class="arrow-link">
						View case study
						<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
					</span>
				</div>
			</a>

			<div class="design-row-wide">
				<a href="/design/nhl-midnight" class="design-img-card">
					<img src="/images/case-studies/nhl-midnight/card-hero.jpg" alt="NHL Midnight Edition dark-mode alternate identities" />
					<div class="design-img-overlay">
						<div>
							<div class="overlay-name">NHL Midnight Edition</div>
							<div class="overlay-tag">Sports identity · 32 teams</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</a>
			</div>

			<div class="design-row">
				<a href="/design" class="design-img-card">
					<img src="/images/gallery/tsu-armadillos.jpg" alt="TSU Armadillos concept" />
					<div class="design-img-overlay">
						<div>
							<div class="overlay-name">TSU Armadillos</div>
							<div class="overlay-tag">Sports identity · Collegiate</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</a>
				<a href="/design" class="design-img-card">
					<img src="/images/gallery/rainbow-warriors.jpg" alt="Hawaii Rainbow Warriors concept" />
					<div class="design-img-overlay">
						<div>
							<div class="overlay-name">Hawaii Rainbow Warriors</div>
							<div class="overlay-tag">Sports identity · Top 8</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</a>
				<a href="/design" class="design-img-card">
					<img src="/images/gallery/BoltsUpdated_2.jpg" alt="Utah Bolts MLB concept" />
					<div class="design-img-overlay">
						<div>
							<div class="overlay-name">Utah Bolts</div>
							<div class="overlay-tag">Sports identity · Baseball</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- CLOSING CTA -->
	<section class="closing-cta">
		<svg class="stripe-mark" style="bottom: -30px; left: -30px; width: 220px; height: 220px; opacity: 0.45;" viewBox="0 0 200 200">
			<g transform="rotate(-22 100 100)">
				<rect x="10" y="40" width="120" height="14" rx="7" fill="var(--accent)" opacity="0.25"/>
				<rect x="30" y="70" width="150" height="14" rx="7" fill="var(--band-text-strong)" opacity="0.08"/>
				<rect x="0" y="100" width="90" height="14" rx="7" fill="var(--accent)" opacity="0.15"/>
			</g>
		</svg>
		<div class="content">
			<h2>Whether your team has a century of history or launches next season.</h2>
			<p>Every project begins with a Legacy Session.</p>
			<a href="/legacy-session" class="btn btn-primary">Start a Legacy Session</a>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- LIGHTBOX -->
	<div id="lightbox" aria-hidden="true" role="dialog" aria-modal="true">
		<div id="lightbox-backdrop"></div>
		<div id="lightbox-frame">
			<img id="lightbox-img" src="" alt="" />
			<div id="lightbox-caption">
				<div id="lightbox-caption-text">
					<div id="lightbox-caption-name"></div>
					<div id="lightbox-caption-cat"></div>
				</div>
				<a href="/design" id="lightbox-more">
					See all sports work
					<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
		<button id="lightbox-close" aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
	</div>

	<script>
		(function () {
			const lb = document.getElementById('lightbox');
			const lbImg = document.getElementById('lightbox-img') as HTMLImageElement;
			const lbName = document.getElementById('lightbox-caption-name');
			const lbCat = document.getElementById('lightbox-caption-cat');
			const lbClose = document.getElementById('lightbox-close');
			const lbBackdrop = document.getElementById('lightbox-backdrop');
			if (!lb || !lbImg || !lbName || !lbCat || !lbClose || !lbBackdrop) return;

			function openLB(src: string, alt: string, name: string, cat: string) {
				lbImg!.src = src;
				lbImg!.alt = alt;
				lbName!.textContent = name;
				lbCat!.textContent = cat;
				lb!.classList.add('open');
				lb!.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'false');
				document.body.style.overflow = 'hidden';
			}

			function closeLB() {
				lb!.classList.remove('open');
				lb!.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'true');
				document.body.style.overflow = '';
				setTimeout(function () { lbImg!.src = ''; }, 200);
			}

			document.querySelectorAll('.design-row .design-img-card').forEach(function (card) {
				card.addEventListener('click', function (e) {
					e.preventDefault();
					const img = card.querySelector('img') as HTMLImageElement;
					const nameEl = card.querySelector('.overlay-name');
					const catEl = card.querySelector('.overlay-tag');
					openLB(img.src, img.alt, nameEl ? nameEl.textContent ?? '' : '', catEl ? catEl.textContent ?? '' : '');
				});
			});

			lbClose.addEventListener('click', closeLB);
			lbBackdrop.addEventListener('click', closeLB);
			document.addEventListener('keydown', function (e) {
				if (e.key === 'Escape') closeLB();
			});
		})();
	</script>
</Layout>

<style>
	/* Dark text for this page's light "rest stop" bands (Problem,
	   Philosophy, Selected Work). global.css's --text-strong/--text-dim
	   are light globally (for the dark canvas), so these bands need
	   their own dark-on-cream pair. Defined on :global(:root) rather
	   than plain :root: Astro scopes styles per-component by adding a
	   data-attribute to matched selectors, and <html> is rendered by
	   Layout.astro, not this page, so a scoped :root rule here would
	   silently never match anything. */
	:global(:root) {
		--band-text-strong: #2a2e28;
		--band-text-dim: #5f645b;
	}

	.content {
		max-width: 1200px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 0 48px;
	}

	/* .eyebrow is defined in global.css (shared pill, every page). */

	/* ═══ DECORATIVE STRIPE MARK ═══ */

	.stripe-mark { position: absolute; pointer-events: none; z-index: 0; }

	/* ═══ HERO ═══ */

	.hero-section {
		background: var(--bg);
		position: relative;
		overflow: hidden;
		padding: 48px 0 72px;
	}

	.hero-grid {
		position: relative;
		z-index: 1;
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
		gap: 48px;
		align-items: center;
	}

	.hero h1 {
		font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
		font-size: var(--fs-hero);
		font-weight: 800;
		letter-spacing: -0.035em;
		line-height: 0.98;
		color: var(--text-on-dark);
		margin-bottom: 22px;
	}

	.hero h1 .accent-word { color: var(--accent); }

	.hero-subhead {
		font-size: var(--fs-lead);
		font-weight: 400;
		color: var(--text-on-dark-dim);
		line-height: 1.55;
		max-width: 480px;
		margin-bottom: 32px;
	}

	.hero-actions { display: flex; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; }

	.hero-image {
		aspect-ratio: 3 / 2;
		border-radius: var(--radius);
		border: 1px solid var(--border-on-dark);
		overflow: hidden;
		background: var(--surface);
	}

	.hero-image img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; }

	.btn {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		gap: 8px;
		padding: 15px 28px;
		border-radius: 100px;
		font-size: var(--fs-small);
		font-weight: 700;
		text-decoration: none;
		transition: all 0.25s ease;
	}

	.btn-primary { background: var(--accent); color: #fff; }
	.btn-primary:hover { background: var(--accent-hover); transform: translateY(-1px); box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.25); }

	.btn-secondary {
		background: transparent;
		color: var(--text-on-dark);
		border: 1.5px solid var(--border-on-dark);
		font-weight: 600;
	}
	.btn-secondary:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }

	/* ═══ PROBLEM (light rest-stop band) ═══ */

	.problem-band {
		background: var(--surface-cream);
		padding: 72px 0;
		position: relative;
		overflow: hidden;
	}

	.problem-line {
		font-size: var(--fs-h2);
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: -0.01em;
		line-height: 1.3;
		max-width: 800px;
		margin-bottom: 16px;
		position: relative;
		z-index: 1;
		color: var(--band-text-strong);
	}

	.problem-sub {
		font-size: var(--fs-body-lg);
		font-weight: 400;
		color: var(--band-text-dim);
		line-height: 1.6;
		max-width: 620px;
		position: relative;
		z-index: 1;
	}

	/* ═══ PHILOSOPHY (soft-oat rest-stop band) ═══ */

	.philosophy-band {
		background: var(--surface-soft);
		padding: 80px 0;
	}

	.philosophy-split {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 0.85fr;
		gap: 48px;
		align-items: start;
	}

	.philosophy { max-width: 600px; }

	.philosophy-image {
		border-radius: var(--radius);
		border: 1px solid var(--border-on-light);
		overflow: hidden;
		aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
		background: var(--surface-card);
	}

	.philosophy-image img {
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		object-fit: cover;
		display: block;
	}

	.philosophy h2 {
		font-size: var(--fs-h2);
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: -0.01em;
		line-height: 1.25;
		color: var(--band-text-strong);
		margin-bottom: 26px;
	}

	.philosophy p:not(.eyebrow) {
		font-size: var(--fs-body-lg);
		font-weight: 400;
		color: var(--band-text-dim);
		line-height: 1.7;
		margin-bottom: 18px;
		max-width: 620px;
	}

	.pull-quote {
		margin-top: 32px;
		padding: 28px 32px;
		border-radius: var(--radius);
		background: var(--accent-dim);
		border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
		color: var(--band-text-strong);
		font-size: var(--fs-lead);
		font-weight: 600;
		line-height: 1.55;
		letter-spacing: -0.005em;
	}

	/* ═══ PROCESS (dark green band, same as hero) ═══ */

	.process-band {
		background: var(--bg);
		color: var(--text-on-dark);
		padding: 80px 0;
		position: relative;
		overflow: hidden;
	}

	.process-band h2 {
		font-size: var(--fs-h2);
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: -0.01em;
		color: var(--text-on-dark);
		margin-bottom: 40px;
		max-width: 560px;
	}

	.process-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
		gap: 18px;
	}

	.process-card {
		background: var(--surface-cream);
		border: 1px solid var(--border-on-light);
		border-radius: var(--radius);
		padding: 24px 22px;
	}

	.process-num {
		display: block;
		font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;
		font-size: 26px;
		font-weight: 400;
		color: var(--accent);
		margin-bottom: 16px;
	}

	.process-card h3 {
		font-size: var(--fs-h4);
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--band-text-strong);
		letter-spacing: -0.01em;
		margin-bottom: 10px;
	}

	.process-card p {
		font-size: var(--fs-small);
		font-weight: 400;
		color: var(--band-text-dim);
		line-height: 1.55;
	}

	/* ═══ SELECTED WORK (light rest-stop band) ═══ */

	.work-band {
		background: var(--surface-cream);
		padding: 80px 0 56px;
	}

	.work-header {
		display: flex;
		align-items: baseline;
		justify-content: space-between;
		margin-bottom: 20px;
		gap: 16px;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
	}

	.work-header .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 0; }

	.cat-tag {
		display: inline-block;
		font-size: var(--fs-micro);
		color: var(--band-text-dim);
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 0.1em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		margin-bottom: 6px;
	}

	.arrow-link { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-size: var(--fs-small); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; color: var(--band-text-strong); transition: gap 0.25s ease, color 0.25s ease; }
	.arrow-link svg { width: 13px; height: 13px; color: var(--accent); }
	.arrow-link:hover { gap: 10px; color: var(--accent); }

	.hero-design {
		display: block;
		background: var(--surface-card);
		border: 1px solid var(--border-on-light);
		border-radius: var(--radius);
		margin-bottom: 16px;
		text-decoration: none;
		color: inherit;
		position: relative;
		overflow: hidden;
		transition: all 0.3s ease;
	}

	.hero-design:hover {
		transform: translateY(-2px);
		box-shadow: 0 16px 48px rgba(0,0,0,0.16);
	}

	.hero-design-image { position: relative; z-index: 1; aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; overflow: hidden; background: var(--surface-card); }
	.hero-design-image img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; transition: transform 0.6s ease; }
	.hero-design:hover .hero-design-image img { transform: scale(1.03); }

	.hero-design-body { position: relative; z-index: 1; padding: 28px 32px 32px; }
	.hero-design-body h2 { font-size: var(--fs-h2); font-weight: 800; color: var(--band-text-strong); letter-spacing: -0.01em; line-height: 1.15; margin-bottom: 10px; }
	.hero-design-desc { position: relative; z-index: 1; font-size: var(--fs-small); font-weight: 400; color: var(--band-text-dim); line-height: 1.6; max-width: 620px; margin-bottom: 16px; }

	.design-img-card {
		position: relative;
		overflow: hidden;
		border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
		background: var(--surface-card);
		display: block;
		text-decoration: none;
	}

	.design-img-card img {
		width: 100%;
		height: auto;
		display: block;
		transition: transform 0.5s ease;
		object-fit: cover;
	}

	.design-img-card:hover img { transform: scale(1.03); }

	.design-img-overlay {
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(17,17,16,0.85) 0%, transparent 50%);
		opacity: 0;
		transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
		display: flex;
		align-items: flex-end;
		padding: 14px;
	}

	.design-img-card:hover .design-img-overlay { opacity: 1; }

	.overlay-name { font-size: var(--fs-small); font-weight: 600; color: #f2ece4; }
	.overlay-tag { font-size: var(--fs-micro); color: #f0b79a; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 2px; }

	.design-row-wide { margin-bottom: 14px; }
	.design-row-wide .design-img-card img { aspect-ratio: 24 / 9; }

	.design-row {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
		gap: 14px;
		margin-bottom: 20px;
	}

	.design-row .design-img-card img { aspect-ratio: 4 / 5; }

	/* ═══ CLOSING CTA ═══ */

	.closing-cta {
		padding: 96px 0;
		text-align: center;
		background: var(--surface-soft);
		color: var(--band-text-strong);
		position: relative;
		overflow: hidden;
	}

	.closing-cta h2 {
		font-size: var(--fs-h1);
		font-weight: 800;
		letter-spacing: -0.015em;
